{"id":"e872081039","t":"The Crown I Will Seize","c":"cv","n":58,"l":58,"s":["ml","mg"],"k":{"ml":"the-crown-i-will-seize","mg":"the-crown-i-will-seize"},"u":1795477984273,"desc":"الشخص الذي كرستُ حياتي كلها لحبه… ما ظننتُه حبًا لم يكن سوى خيانة. بسبب جهلي، مات أخي الملك، وانهارت بلادي في صمت. “لقد… عدتُ.” لكن هذه الحياة لن تعود كما كانت. سيتلاشى المجد الذي مُنح لعمي، وسيُنتزع التاج اللامع الذي كان على زوجي. حتى لو اضطررتُ لحرق كل ما أملك، حتى لو اضطررتُ لشق طريقي بدمك، فلن أتوقف.","type":"مانهوا","status":"OnGoing","genres":["خيال","دراما","رومانسى","شوجو","فانتازا","مأساوي","مانهوا"],"src":{"ml":"the-crown-i-will-seize","mg":"the-crown-i-will-seize"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"the-crown-i-will-seize|/manga/the-crown-i-will-seize/1/","mg":"the-crown-i-will-seize|"},"2":{"ml":"the-crown-i-will-seize|/manga/the-crown-i-will-seize/2/","mg":"the-crown-i-will-seize|"},"3":{"ml":"the-crown-i-will-seize|/manga/the-crown-i-will-seize/3/","mg":"the-crown-i-will-seize|"},"4":{"ml":"the-crown-i-will-seize|/manga/the-crown-i-will-seize/4/","mg":"the-crown-i-will-seize|"},"5":{"ml":"the-crown-i-will-seize|/manga/the-crown-i-will-seize/5/","mg":"the-crown-i-will-seize|"},"6":{"ml":"the-crown-i-will-seize|/manga/the-crown-i-will-seize/6/","mg":"the-crown-i-will-seize|"},"7":{"ml":"the-crown-i-will-seize|/manga/the-crown-i-will-seize/7/","mg":"the-crown-i-will-seize|"},"8":{"ml":"the-crown-i-will-seize|/manga/the-crown-i-will-seize/8/","mg":"the-crown-i-will-seize|"},"9":{"ml":"the-crown-i-will-seize|/manga/the-crown-i-will-seize/9/","mg":"the-crown-i-will-seize|"},"10":{"ml":"the-crown-i-will-seize|/manga/the-crown-i-will-seize/10/","mg":"the-crown-i-will-seize|"},"11":{"ml":"the-crown-i-will-seize|/manga/the-crown-i-will-seize/11/","mg":"the-crown-i-will-seize|"},"12":{"ml":"the-crown-i-will-seize|/manga/the-crown-i-will-seize/12/","mg":"the-crown-i-will-seize|"},"13":{"ml":"the-crown-i-will-seize|/manga/the-crown-i-will-seize/13/","mg":"the-crown-i-will-seize|"},"14":{"ml":"the-crow